{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789abc",
		"name": "Internal Transfers API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Internal Transfers Application\n\n## Features\n- Account creation with initial balances\n- Account balance queries\n- Financial transactions between accounts\n- Health monitoring\n- Error handling examples\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set the `base_url` environment variable to your API server (default: http://localhost:8080)\n3. Run the requests in order for a complete workflow\n\n## Business Rules\n- Account IDs must be positive integers\n- Initial balances cannot be negative\n- Transaction amounts must be positive\n- Source and destination accounts must be different\n- All operations are atomic (succeed completely or fail)\n\nFor detailed documentation, see the API specification.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
